WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:01,600
Come, come, come to me

2
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:12,350
When can we leave this damn place?

3
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,860
Although already registered

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,680
But I still need to hand in this booklet.

5
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,000
Let the person above record it

6
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,360
Then I will make toothpastes for you

7
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,960
Get the dental card

8
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:28,530
Only then can you be happy going in and out of various places in Omae, right?

9
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:43,180
Naturally, I am happy that Commander Wei

10
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,600
You should tell me something

11
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:49,420
I know I can't hide it from you, okay?

12
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,740
In addition to giving you toothpastes today,

13
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:55,180
There is one more thing I want to ask you about

14
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,940
I don’t know if you have the intention to join the military camp.
